                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does summer drive for sunscreen brands?</h3>
                                        <p>40-60% of annual sunscreen revenue concentrates in summer window. Sun protection education compounds year-round preparation.</p>
                                        <h3>Should skincare brands change formulations for summer?</h3>
                                        <p>Ideally yes — lightweight + gel + water-based summer SKUs. Alternative: summer-specific content + layered routine guidance.</p>
                                        <h3>Is UAE summer opportunity or challenge?</h3>
                                        <p>Both. Extreme heat reduces outdoor + drives indoor + AC + hydration + specific summer categories. Ramadan often overlaps summer requiring dual planning.</p>
                                        <h3>How do multi-region brands handle summer?</h3>
                                        <p>Plan per hemisphere — India April-June + Northern Hemisphere June-August + Southern Hemisphere Dec-Feb. Different content per market.</p>
